  "title": "Custom printed double wall coffee cups",
  "category": "coffee-cups",
  "status": "published",
  "short_description": "Your coffee. Your character. A custom printed double wall cup that keeps drinks warm and puts your brand in every hand.",
  "description": "A double wall paper cup adds a second paper layer around the drink, so it keeps drinks warm and is comfortable to hold. We print the outside with a full-colour wrap of your artwork, in 6, 8, 12 and 16 oz — from espresso-based drinks to large lattes.\n\nChoose a recyclable PE lining or a compostable PLA lining, and a gloss or matte finish at the same price. White board is priced online; kraft board is quoted on request, and matching lids are quoted separately. Not sure which lining suits you? Read our guide to [compostable vs recyclable coffee cups](/guides/compostable-vs-recyclable-coffee-cups/).\n\nServing iced drinks too? See our [custom printed cold cups](/coffee-cups/cold-cups/). Prefer to keep your current cups? [Printed cup sleeves](/coffee-cups/cup-sleeves/) put your brand on them instead.\n\nYour digital proof and print plates are included in the price. Final specifications are confirmed with your written quote.",
  "benefits": [
    "Full-colour printing",
    "Four cup sizes",
    "Your own artwork"
  ],
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "Can I use my own design?",
      "a": "Yes. Share your logo or print-ready artwork when requesting a quote. We will confirm the artwork requirements for your chosen cup, and you approve a digital proof before anything is printed."
    },
    {
      "q": "What if my artwork is not ready?",
      "a": "You can request a quote first and share your artwork later. Tell us what you have in mind and we can discuss the next steps."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are the prices shown final?",
      "a": "The prices on this page are indicative and exclude VAT, which is added at 20%. Your digital proof and print plates are included, and delivery is free to a single UK mainland address. We confirm everything in a written quote before you commit."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are lids included?",
      "a": "The prices cover cups only. Tell us if you need matching lids and we will include them in your quote."
    },
    {
      "q": "When will my cups arrive?",
      "a": "Printed cups are delivered in under a month from artwork approval. We will confirm current availability and delivery timing with your quote."
    }
  ],
